### Branch Strategy and Step‑by‑Step GitHub Workflow

#### 1. Initial setup

1. Create a new repo on GitHub:  
   `Customer-Information-System` (or similar).
2. Locally:
   ```bash
   git init
   git remote add origin https://github.com/<your-username>/<your-repo>.git
   git add index.html style.css script.js README.md
   git commit -m "Initial commit: CRM MVP"
   git branch -M main
   git push -u origin main
